    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d466-a1">

                <pb facs="0574" n="506" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v01/pg506"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure—Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Austro-Hungarian Minister of Foreign Affairs</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Burian</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Austro-Hungarian Chargé</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Zwiedinek</hi>)</head>
                <p>American note handed over to me 21st inst. Tell Secretary of State that the
                    answer we are preparing shall be guided by the same concern for good relations
                    between both countries as mentioned by Federal Government. In consequence of the
                    Christmas holidays our answer cannot be expected before next week.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Burian</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
